00:14:28.930 --> 00:14:31.135
And so in this example,

00:14:31.135 --> 00:14:34.525
Pi star of S, um,

00:14:34.525 --> 00:14:36.955
it's not well defined because well,

00:14:36.955 --> 00:14:40.930
