But Pi star and L_t, uh,

01:18:43.240 --> 01:18:53.485
do not depend on the Sigma w. Okay.

01:18:53.485 --> 01:18:57.144
Um, so this is a property that is very specific to LQR,

01:18:57.144 --> 01:19:00.835
